  "owner": "core/package",
  "responsibility_boundary": "Wave 33 separates the Episode CLI command family from the general storage command facade, while renewing the complete protected core/package helper issue root inherited from earlier decomposition waves.",
  "cohesion_rationale": "The Episode CLI helper is one cohesive command family with its own lifecycle, recovery, payload attachment, preflight, and rendering behavior. A single owner reduces storage.py below 1000 lines without proliferating per-command modules, while the exact scope, measurements, and allowance renew the complete owner-wide issue root.",
  "rejected_split_alternatives": [
    "Keeping Episode commands in storage.py would retain the 1358-line CLI monolith.",
    "Splitting individual Click commands into arbitrary micro-files would add registration indirection without independent responsibility.",
    "Moving general storage commands or altering the public kungfu.cli.commands.storage module would enlarge the compatibility surface without further reducing this threshold debt."
  ],
  "affected_tests_and_qualification": [
    "55 focused pinned-runtime storage CLI, query, diagnostics, backend, and decomposition tests",
